Clif reaches into his robes with a flourish and pulls out a small ornate pouch. His movements are theatrical and triumphant. He's enjoying this moment - the grand exit. His expression is gleeful rebellion. He holds the pouch up for everyone to see. His voice is confident and slightly smug. He's been waiting to use this line. His other hand still holds his staff.

