## SCENE 6: SHIP IN CRISIS
**Estimated Duration: 3:35 - 3:50 (15 seconds)**

### SHOT 44 - FIRST OFFICER ALERT - MEDIUM SHOT
**Duration: 3:35 - 3:38 (3 seconds)**

**Shot Type:** Medium shot
**Camera Movement:** Static
**Framing:** Standing, straight on

