## PRODUCTION SUMMARY

**Total Runtime:** Approximately 3 minutes 30 seconds (210 seconds)
**Total Shots:** 53 shots
**Average Shot Length:** 3.96 seconds
**Scenes:** 6 major scenes
**Locations:** 2 (Engine Room, Conference Room)
**Cast:** 4 principal actors (Clif, Heidi, Captain, First Officer) + 1 voice (Ensign)

**Key Technical Requirements:**
- Green screen/VFX for magical effects (flames, sparkles, disappearance)
- Practical effects (smoke, flash pots, floating candles)
- Starfleet set design (engine room and conference room)
- Costumes (Starfleet uniforms, wizard robes)
- Props (staff, wands, PADD, flu powder pouch)
- Sound design (magical effects, ship sounds, klaxons)
- Camera shake/vibration effects
- Lighting (blue warp core, green flames, red alert)

**Character Descriptions Per 10-Second Segments:**
All scene descriptions maintain under 5000 characters per 10 seconds of screen time as requested, with detailed shot-by-shot breakdowns including camera work, performance notes, technical requirements, and dialogue.

